+   "what_happened": "The generator DIED under concurrency. Signature: `llama_servers` drops from 2 to 1 (the probe's own server disappears; an unrelated wedged one survives), `generator_healthy_after` flips True->False, `llm_responses` collapses to 0-1, `tokens_predicted` to ~0 -- and every cell still returns exit code 0 with a complete 400-action run. `forbid_spawn` is why it stays dead for the rest of the batch: that is the deliberate trade (one lost batch instead of a second 12 GiB model forked onto the card being measured).",
